items.fromString:
Split from AIPCC-21223 to unblock the NVSHMEM and NCCL updates.

Pin UCX to exact version (1.20.1) via new {{UCX_VERSION}} variable in the builder, replacing the {{>= 1.19}} floor in {{dnf-install-cuda.sh}}. This matches the NVSHMEM/NCCL pinning pattern.

Affects:

* {{build-args/cuda12.9-ubi9.conf}}
* {{build-args/cuda13.0-ubi9.conf}}
* {{build-args/cuda13.2-ubi9.conf}}
* {{container-install/dnf-install-cuda.sh}}
* {{containerfiles/cuda-ubi9}}
* {{Containerfile.cuda-ubi9}}

Blocked on missing UCX RPM. See AIPCC-21322 and AIPCC-21325 for the RPM packaging work.

